      "statement": "The live repository workflow gates scheduled runs so they only fire in the origin repo (langchain-ai/openwiki) or when a fork opts in via the OPENWIKI_ENABLE_SCHEDULED_UPDATE repository variable, while workflow_dispatch always remains available, preventing contributor forks from silently arming a daily job that needs a provider secret.",
